IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P7-testing`

-- P7-tests-testing: tests for P7-testing. Every expected value is written from the text beside the assertion, never copied from the output.
-- Each assertion is on one line; NOTHING is "not covered".

-- Art 60(1): as enacted only Annex III systems; as amended Annex III systems and systems covered by Section A of Annex I
-- args (as enacted): route, in accordance with this Article and the plan
#ASSERT `Art 60(1) as enacted the provider may conduct testing in real world conditions outside the sandboxes` `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 60(1) as enacted the provider may conduct testing in real world conditions outside the sandboxes` `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 60(1) as enacted the provider may conduct testing in real world conditions outside the sandboxes` `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 60(1) as enacted the provider may conduct testing in real world conditions outside the sandboxes` `Route neither` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args (as amended): route, covered by Section A of Annex I, in accordance
