#ASSERT `Art 60(1) the provider may conduct testing in real world conditions outside the sandboxes` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route neither` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- S14: where the keel says Article 2(2) cuts the provision off (a Section B product under Article 6(1)) the answer is a flat no; where it says nothing the provision answers for itself
-- args: date asked, route, Section B products, requirements integrated, Section A, in accordance. Article 2(2) as amended: for a Section B system under Article 6(1) "only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 shall apply": Article 60 is not on the list, integrated or not
#ASSERT `Art 60(1) the provider may conduct testing in real world conditions outside the sandboxes` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 60(1) the provider may conduct testing in real world conditions outside the sandboxes` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
